    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūdātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a sweating</i>, <i>perspiration</i>, <i>sudation</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 86, 5</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 3, 2 <i>med.</i></span></i> —*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in concr., <i>a
				sweatingroom</i>, <i>sudatory</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concamerata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					5, 11 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			</div>
